.outfit===i.id?'EQUIPPED ✓':'EQUIP'}</button></div>`).join(''):'<div class="notice">Your wardrobe is ready for its first addition. Browse the clothing market above.</div>';$$('[data-equip]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{state.outfit=button.dataset.equip;renderAvatar();save();renderShop(document.querySelector('.shop-tab.active')?.dataset.shop||'clothing')}))}
